+# GeneralsX @feature Zero Hour Reforged 11/11/2026 The Reforged 60-steps
+# engine (Zero Hour only): a second build of z_generals with
+# REFORGED_60_STEPS=ON, packaged under its own name -- NOT libmain60.so,
